    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Modal verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Potere** (can), **volere** (to want) and **dovere** (must, have to) are irregular. They are followed by an **infinitive**: **Posso entrare?** (can I come in?), **Voglio mangiare** (I want to eat), **Devo lavorare** (I have to work).",
      "The negative goes before the first verb: **Non posso venire** (I can't come)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
