    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Know or can",
     "texto": [
      "For a learned skill, **sapere** is used: **So nuotare** (I know how to swim), **Sai guidare?** (do you know how to drive?).",
      "For a possibility or permission, **potere** is used: **Posso aprire la finestra?** (can I open the window?).",
      "To ask a favour: **Puoi aiutarmi?** (can you help me?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
